      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that but it doesnt feel real. everything feels like its just simulated. i'm just stuck in this loop of working and sleeping and staring at screens. it feels like there's no actual difference between being \"alive\" and just running a program that's supposed to mimic life. like, if the program is broken, why keep running it?",
